      "title": "Read each clip's own settings",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "PER-CLIP SETTINGS\n\nClips from one batch are often NOT uniform. Read each clip's OWN embedded workflow rather than assuming:\n\n  ffprobe -v error -show_entries format_tags=prompt -of json yourclip.mp4\n\nThings that commonly vary within a single batch: step count, sampler, whether a turbo LoRA was used at all, and how many reference images were attached.\n\nMirror the clip's own steps / sampler / LoRA / refs here, and change only the denoise settings."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
